{"id":"wb-2-41","name":"网师园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"网师园","text":"网师园位于江苏省苏州市姑苏区阔家头巷11号，始建于南宋时期（1127年到1279年），原本只是取名叫“渔隐”的小型私人花园，经过多次修建，清朝乾隆时期（1736年到1796年），改名为网师园。\n1982年，列为第二批全国重点文物保护单位。1997年，与其它三座苏州古典园林一同被列为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BD%91%E5%B8%88%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":92762469,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92762469","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3f0cdcf2f7f42177df3bdf1e.jpg","title":"Master_of_the_Nets_Garden_Suzhou.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Master_of_the_Nets_Garden_Suzhou.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Master_of_the_Nets_Garden_Suzhou.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"xiquinhosilva","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"​苏州网师园","width":320,"height":213}}